    <a href="https://docs.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/embeddings/get-text-embeddings" target="_blank">Google Vertex AI - Text embeddings</a>
    <a href="https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-8B" target="_blank">Qwen3-Embedding model card</a>
    <a href="https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/embeddings" target="_blank">Anthropic - Embeddings con Voyage AI</a>
    <a href="https://docs.cohere.com/docs/cohere-embed" target="_blank">Cohere - Embed models</a>
    <a href="https://docs.mistral.ai/capabilities/embeddings/code_embeddings" target="_blank">Mistral - Codestral Embed</a>
    <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.03216" target="_blank">BGE-M3 paper</a>
    <a href="https://huggingface.co/intfloat/e5-mistral-7b-instruct" target="_blank">E5-Mistral model card</a>
