    <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.19887" target="_blank">Jamba - Hybrid Transformer-Mamba</a>
    <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.09871" target="_blank">Byte Latent Transformer</a>
  </div>
